 "channel": "Festival of Tolerance - JFF Zageb",
 "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCN-NUZXlU7ibwUxNCFTr43g",
 "description": "Festival of Tolerance – JFF Zagreb is a cultural and educational platform that promotes tolerance, human rights, and active citizenship through film, art, education, and public dialogue. We bring together filmmakers, experts, young people, and the wider community to address important social issues and build safer, more inclusive communities.\n\nDijalogija is an educational program of the Festival of Tolerance focused on preventing peer violence, strengthening empathy, and encouraging responsible action. Through dialogue, workshops, and practical tools, we empower children, youth, and adults to recognize violence, respond safely, and provide support. The program is implemented with the support of the City of Zagreb.\nwww.festivaloftolerance.com",
